 ```
 
-Sessions never expire.
+Sessions expire `SESSION_TTL` (3600 seconds / 1 hour) after they are saved. Restoring
+an expired session raises `ValueError`. Expired entries are also purged from the
+on-disk cache whenever a session is restored.
